   "lines": [
    "sweet sympathy in",
    "return; no one but",
    "my wife, if ever I",
    "marry, will ever",
    "be able to take his",
    "place.",
    "I so wonder who",
    "my wife will be!",
    "\"A rare and radi-",
    "-ant maiden\" I hope;",
    "one who will be as",
    "sweet, pure and",
    "innocent as she",
    "is wise. Thank",
    "Heaven, I am at",
    "least perfectly",
    "pure."
   ],
